WEBVTT

00:00:12.530 --> 00:00:14.820
Dauuhh...

00:00:18.830 --> 00:00:21.050
Udaah...

00:00:22.680 --> 00:00:24.130
Here, I'll feed you!

00:00:24.130 --> 00:00:26.650
Open your mouth! Come on!

00:00:26.650 --> 00:00:28.690
Eat the moss ball!

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:32.230
His dad owns some mining company, I heard.

00:00:32.230 --> 00:00:35.340
Maybe you're too good to eat moss balls, huh?

00:00:35.340 --> 00:00:38.500
Huh? You guys eat moss balls?

00:00:38.500 --> 00:00:41.430
When you're poor, you have 
to eat moss balls, huh?

00:00:43.430 --> 00:00:45.230
Somebody!

00:00:45.230 --> 00:00:47.690
Somebody help me!

00:00:49.660 --> 00:00:52.580
I'm going to freeze to 
death when the sun sets.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.130
Awuoh...

00:00:56.380 --> 00:00:57.990
Pus...

00:00:57.990 --> 00:01:01.370
Um, will you help me?

00:01:02.500 --> 00:01:03.930
Ussy...

00:01:05.460 --> 00:01:10.710
Wait! You're hungry, right? I've got food!

00:01:10.710 --> 00:01:12.360
Dried peaches!

00:01:12.360 --> 00:01:14.740
I'll give them to you, so let me down!

00:01:14.740 --> 00:01:15.800
Pweach?

00:01:16.270 --> 00:01:19.510
My grandfather in Yamanashi sends them to me.

00:01:21.960 --> 00:01:26.140
Nom, nom, nom...

00:01:23.900 --> 00:01:26.140
It's good, isn't it?

00:01:26.140 --> 00:01:28.230
Will you let me down, then?

00:01:28.570 --> 00:01:30.150
Pus...

00:01:30.150 --> 00:01:31.170
Yeah!

00:01:31.730 --> 00:01:34.360
Wait, no! Not like that...

00:01:40.030 --> 00:01:42.450
Not like that, but holy crap!

00:01:43.560 --> 00:01:45.340
Thank you for saving me!

00:01:45.340 --> 00:01:46.460
Undah...

00:01:46.460 --> 00:01:49.540
My name's Chiyotarou!

00:01:49.540 --> 00:01:50.670
What's your name?

00:01:50.900 --> 00:01:52.590
Pussy.

00:01:52.810 --> 00:01:56.540
Pussy! That's your name, huh?

00:01:56.540 --> 00:02:01.220
I'll give you some more dried peaches, 
so from now on, you work for me, Pussy.

00:02:01.220 --> 00:02:03.470
Pussy!

00:02:03.470 --> 00:02:08.100
Yes! I've got my own personal servant,
 the Pussy Monster!

00:02:49.960 --> 00:02:58.650
<b>Golden Kamuy</b>

00:03:41.720 --> 00:03:46.550
<b>Episode Thirty-Eight
Cocoon</b>

00:03:42.330 --> 00:03:47.030
As one of the Shinsengumi, he survived 
countless deadly battles in Kyoto,

00:03:47.030 --> 00:03:48.990
and then the Battle of Hakodate, too.

00:03:48.990 --> 00:03:52.140
Then he escaped from Abashiri 
Prison at the ends of the Earth.

00:03:52.140 --> 00:03:53.790
Hijikata Toshizou...

00:03:54.040 --> 00:03:57.390
A man like that, fated to die like this?

00:04:07.940 --> 00:04:09.310
Ushiyama's gone?

00:04:09.550 --> 00:04:13.410
Impossible! He broke out of 
his coffin and crawled out?

00:04:13.410 --> 00:04:16.560
Damn it! I underestimated him!

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:21.490
But the last poison I gave him was datura,

00:04:21.490 --> 00:04:23.690
and it'll take another 12 hours to wear off.

00:04:23.690 --> 00:04:25.700
He probably doesn't remember 
this place, either.

00:04:26.760 --> 00:04:29.540
Pussy? You in there, Pussy?

00:04:29.540 --> 00:04:31.460
I brought you food.

00:04:31.460 --> 00:04:32.910
Meow...

00:04:33.170 --> 00:04:34.950
Are you cold?

00:04:34.950 --> 00:04:38.500
Sorry, I can't take you home with me.

00:04:39.730 --> 00:04:42.210
Let's skate together today!

00:04:42.490 --> 00:04:45.630
Don't worry, I'll show you how.

00:04:45.630 --> 00:04:48.510
<b>Inn</b>

00:04:46.530 --> 00:04:48.510
Wake up, sir!

00:04:50.050 --> 00:04:51.030
What is it?

00:04:51.030 --> 00:04:55.520
Someone came and said to give 
this to a "Chief Warden Kadokura."

00:04:55.760 --> 00:04:59.210
And how does he know my name?

00:04:59.210 --> 00:05:00.680
Don't ask me.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:02.570
I'll leave it here.

00:05:12.980 --> 00:05:14.080
This is...

00:05:14.380 --> 00:05:15.620
Nagakura-san!

00:05:15.830 --> 00:05:17.180
Nagakura's not here.

00:05:17.180 --> 00:05:18.750
Where'd he go?

00:05:18.750 --> 00:05:23.010
He said a tanuki would be of no use 
to him, and left on his own to search.

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:27.650
It's Sekiya. Sekiya kidnapped Hijikata-san.

00:05:28.020 --> 00:05:30.510
He sent us a threat letter!

00:05:33.170 --> 00:05:36.770
<i>The fugu poison has put Hijikata Toshizou
 in something close to a coma.</i>

00:05:37.030 --> 00:05:41.150
<i>His breathing is shallow, but he only has 
a few more hours of air in that coffin.</i>

00:05:41.670 --> 00:05:46.110
<i>I'll trade the tattooed skins 
they have for his location.</i>

00:05:46.530 --> 00:05:50.030
There's no proof that 
Hijikata Nispa is alive.

00:05:50.030 --> 00:05:54.220
Sekiya's pulled the same 
stunt a bunch of times.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:57.470
He's acting alone, so he 
can't watch his hostages.

00:05:57.470 --> 00:06:01.170
He buries them while he goes 
to get the ransom money.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:05.470
He's careful. He always 
leaves the hostages alive.

00:06:05.470 --> 00:06:09.180
He accepts that his hostages 
may be fated to survive.

00:06:09.180 --> 00:06:14.180
<b>Inn</b>

00:06:09.670 --> 00:06:12.770
Nagakura-san's got the skins.

00:06:12.770 --> 00:06:14.180
We need to find him.

00:06:14.180 --> 00:06:18.600
Damn it! There's no time before the handover!

00:06:18.600 --> 00:06:21.810
And if we fail, Hijikata-san will die!

00:06:26.240 --> 00:06:28.110
Moo!

00:06:28.110 --> 00:06:31.740
You're great! Wow, you're a genius!

00:06:32.050 --> 00:06:36.720
<i>Ushiyama is wearing geta skates,
 also known as "gerori."</i>

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:41.250
<i>They were enormously popular in Hokkaido 
in the latter half of the Edo period!</i>

00:06:41.250 --> 00:06:46.030
Moo!

00:06:43.390 --> 00:06:45.250
Hey, rich kid.

00:06:46.760 --> 00:06:49.880
We warned you not to play here.

00:06:49.880 --> 00:06:52.580
Or are you hungry for more moss balls?

00:06:54.700 --> 00:06:56.390
Udah...

00:06:57.220 --> 00:06:58.390
Wh-Who are you?

00:06:59.640 --> 00:07:01.510
This is Pussy.

00:07:01.510 --> 00:07:03.100
Nom, nom...

00:07:03.100 --> 00:07:04.820
Crouch down for a second.

00:07:07.110 --> 00:07:09.070
He works for me!

00:07:11.710 --> 00:07:13.010
What's wrong?

00:07:13.010 --> 00:07:15.660
Weren't you going to feed me a moss ball?

00:07:15.880 --> 00:07:17.050
Take this!

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:22.080
Low-life scum. Let's go, Pussy.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:23.450
It's not worth hanging out with poors.

00:07:29.210 --> 00:07:30.670
I'm sorry!

00:07:30.670 --> 00:07:32.280
Pussy, no!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:38.030
Stop it! Stop it, already!

00:07:38.030 --> 00:07:39.490
Here, a peach!

00:07:39.490 --> 00:07:42.310
It's your favorite, Pussy!

00:07:42.310 --> 00:07:44.940
Peach...

00:07:46.390 --> 00:07:48.320
<i>Oh, no!</i>

00:07:48.610 --> 00:07:52.070
<i>I didn't realize the Pussy 
Monster was this dangerous!</i>

00:07:52.690 --> 00:07:56.070
<i>He's... a deadly weapon!</i>

00:07:56.590 --> 00:07:58.450
<i>I must get rid of him.</i>

00:07:59.780 --> 00:08:02.210
Kirawus, wait up!

00:08:02.420 --> 00:08:04.400
Let's take a break.

00:08:04.400 --> 00:08:07.630
I can't run anymore. I can't breathe...

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:09.870
I'll die before he does.

00:08:10.740 --> 00:08:12.220
Old man...

00:08:12.620 --> 00:08:14.890
We need to find Nagakura Nispa!

00:08:15.130 --> 00:08:16.900
There's no time.

00:08:16.900 --> 00:08:22.570
Sekiya doesn't know how many 
tattooed skins we have, right?

00:08:23.190 --> 00:08:28.400
We'll have to bluff him into telling 
us where Hijikata is somehow.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:30.590
"Somehow"? How?

00:08:30.590 --> 00:08:33.510
You'll fail if you don't 
have a real plan, Kadokura!

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:37.660
You got any brilliant ideas, 
then? Let's hear them!

00:08:37.660 --> 00:08:40.870
You don't, do you? You broke-ass!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:45.500
You're unemployed and broke, too,
 Mr. Asshole Examiner.

00:08:46.430 --> 00:08:49.000
I must protect my town!

00:08:49.000 --> 00:08:51.200
Boytarou!

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:54.290
Moo!

00:08:52.700 --> 00:08:54.290
I have to do it!

00:08:54.620 --> 00:08:58.050
<i>Lake Akan has natural hot 
springs on its bottom,</i>

00:08:58.050 --> 00:08:59.880
<i>and even when the lake 
surface freezes in winter,</i>

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:03.020
<i>there are places call "steam 
pots" where holes form.</i>

00:09:04.010 --> 00:09:05.940
Come here, Pussy.

00:09:14.280 --> 00:09:16.360
Chief Warden Kadokura, stop where you are.

00:09:16.900 --> 00:09:19.350
Take off your clothes, and throw them at me.

00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.620
I want to be sure you came unarmed.

00:09:21.620 --> 00:09:24.930
I stuffed a hunting rifle up my ass.

00:09:24.930 --> 00:09:27.120
Want to take a look and see, Sekiya?

00:09:27.500 --> 00:09:31.210
<i>He's careful, and smart.</i>

00:09:31.970 --> 00:09:36.930
<i>Sekiya chose the middle of the 
lake as the place for the handover</i>

00:09:36.930 --> 00:09:41.670
<i>because there's a minimum of one 
kilometer to the banks on all sides.</i>

00:09:41.670 --> 00:09:44.470
<i>Nobody can pull off a 
sniper shot at that range.</i>

00:09:49.480 --> 00:09:51.810
So, where are the skins?

00:09:51.810 --> 00:09:53.050
I brought 'em.

00:09:53.050 --> 00:09:55.610
Check my coat.

00:09:55.610 --> 00:09:59.740
One wrong move and the deal's off.

00:10:01.750 --> 00:10:03.370
Well, that's a problem.

00:10:04.220 --> 00:10:05.750
You just looked behind you.

00:10:06.450 --> 00:10:08.370
Wh-What do you mean?

00:10:09.090 --> 00:10:13.210
Is the Ainu who was with 
you on the opposite bank?

00:10:14.670 --> 00:10:19.300
Did you borrow the blade you've got 
wedged between your ass cheeks from him?

00:10:20.680 --> 00:10:24.710
This is important to me. My father 
made it. Be careful with it.

00:10:25.080 --> 00:10:26.600
Where will you hide it?

00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.600
Yeah, got it.

00:10:28.600 --> 00:10:30.310
Where will you hide it?

00:10:32.650 --> 00:10:37.530
So the plan was to extract the location 
of Hijikata Toshizou from me by force?

00:10:38.060 --> 00:10:40.950
You're as crude and sloppy as ever.

00:10:43.960 --> 00:10:49.700
Kadokura-san, what do you think? Is God real?

00:10:50.250 --> 00:10:54.090
Come on! If you don't come get it,
 I'll throw this peach away!

00:10:54.090 --> 00:10:55.060
Are you okay with that?

00:10:55.060 --> 00:10:56.630
Udah...

00:10:56.630 --> 00:10:59.170
Hurry! Or I'll throw it away!

00:11:06.710 --> 00:11:08.430
Go get it!

00:11:08.430 --> 00:11:10.140
Moo!

00:11:10.550 --> 00:11:11.650
I'm sorry!

00:11:17.090 --> 00:11:19.000
I'm sorry, Pussy!

00:11:19.000 --> 00:11:20.780
Forgive me!

00:11:28.220 --> 00:11:29.000
Gerori!

00:11:33.210 --> 00:11:35.060
Damn it! He got me!

00:11:35.060 --> 00:11:36.550
Wait, Sekiya!

00:11:37.290 --> 00:11:38.960
<i>Gotcha, fuckface.</i>

00:11:39.400 --> 00:11:43.800
You're unemployed and broke, too,
 Mr. Asshole Examiner.

00:11:44.070 --> 00:11:46.740
Shut up and think!

00:11:46.740 --> 00:11:49.640
Well? You don't have any good ideas, do you?

00:11:49.640 --> 00:11:56.270
We deliberately screw up the deal so 
he runs, and then I'll follow him in secret.

00:11:56.270 --> 00:12:00.690
He'll return to Hijikata Nispa and 
Ushiyama Nispa to take their skins.

00:12:00.690 --> 00:12:02.280
Yeah, we'll go with that.

00:12:03.010 --> 00:12:06.610
<i>There ain't nobody in the 
direction I was just looking!</i>

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:09.970
<i>Sekiya will probably run for 
the farthest edge of the lake,</i>

00:12:09.970 --> 00:12:12.780
<i>while keeping his distance from the coasts.</i>

00:12:12.780 --> 00:12:17.130
<i>I'll pretend to chase after him 
while guiding him toward you.</i>

00:12:17.130 --> 00:12:19.380
He's here! Just like we planned!

00:12:20.510 --> 00:12:22.630
Wait!

00:12:25.270 --> 00:12:25.970
Ushiyama?

00:12:27.720 --> 00:12:32.730
<i>In that moment, the effects of the 
datura Ushiyama ingested wore off!</i>

00:12:33.020 --> 00:12:35.520
Sekiya, you bastard!

00:12:35.520 --> 00:12:40.780
Ushiyama-san, why are you showing 
up there of all places?

00:12:41.100 --> 00:12:44.780
Crap! Don't let him get away!
 Catch him, Kadokura!

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:51.080
Ow! Ow! My skin's coming off!

00:12:55.530 --> 00:12:57.550
What a mistake.

00:12:57.550 --> 00:12:58.710
Talk about bad luck...

00:13:00.190 --> 00:13:05.090
<b>Golden Kamuy</b>

00:13:06.190 --> 00:13:10.500
Ushiyama-san, Sekiya kidnapped you, too?

00:13:10.500 --> 00:13:11.670
Where were you?

00:13:11.670 --> 00:13:14.140
Hijikata-san may be there, too.

00:13:15.260 --> 00:13:16.730
I don't know.

00:13:16.730 --> 00:13:19.520
I woke up and my head was 
poking out of the ice.

00:13:20.220 --> 00:13:24.260
Maybe that whore was bought off by Sekiya.

00:13:24.260 --> 00:13:29.010
I remember she gave me something 
she said would make me rock hard...

00:13:29.010 --> 00:13:30.970
Dick-for-brains!

00:13:30.970 --> 00:13:33.610
Betrayed by another whore...

00:13:38.260 --> 00:13:42.970
This is the white shell that 
we saw where Hijikata-san was seen.

00:13:42.970 --> 00:13:48.340
And one fell out of your jacket after
 you went missing, too, which means...

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:51.350
The mystery has deepened!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.810
That's a silkworm cocoon.

00:13:53.810 --> 00:13:55.150
Cold...

00:13:55.150 --> 00:13:59.590
Perhaps it got stuck in his 
clothing in the place he was held.

00:14:00.150 --> 00:14:02.350
You don't raise silkworms in winter,

00:14:02.350 --> 00:14:04.820
so some of the buildings are uninhabited.

00:14:04.820 --> 00:14:06.030
That's it!

00:14:06.030 --> 00:14:09.240
The points have connected and formed a line!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:10.990
A line like a silkworm's thread!

00:14:11.300 --> 00:14:14.110
Nearby silkworm farms are that way.

00:14:14.110 --> 00:14:16.580
And that way, at the opposite end of the lake.

00:14:16.580 --> 00:14:18.730
Okay, we're running out of time.

00:14:18.730 --> 00:14:21.590
Let's split up and catch Sekiya!

00:14:32.930 --> 00:14:34.260
Sekiya!

00:14:34.470 --> 00:14:36.700
Hijikata-san's inside, right?

00:14:36.700 --> 00:14:38.490
Take me to him now.

00:14:38.490 --> 00:14:42.540
I'm amazed you found this place,
 Chief Warden Kadokura.

00:14:42.540 --> 00:14:46.030
Don't underestimate Detective Kadokura!

00:14:46.760 --> 00:14:47.800
This way.

00:14:56.430 --> 00:14:59.540
I was just trying this.

00:14:59.850 --> 00:15:02.090
A cocoon sex identifier.

00:15:02.090 --> 00:15:05.410
It uses the fact that the males 
and females inside the cocoons

00:15:05.410 --> 00:15:07.420
have different weights to distinguish them.

00:15:10.060 --> 00:15:13.050
This farm has a different room 
for every step of the process.

00:15:13.480 --> 00:15:16.930
There are over ten rooms between 
this building and the next.

00:15:17.390 --> 00:15:20.500
Hijikata Toshizou is buried in one of them.

00:15:21.180 --> 00:15:25.610
Chief Warden Kadokura, 
I'm giving you a trial to pass.

00:15:25.870 --> 00:15:29.490
Half the cocoons contain 
fatal amounts of wolfsbane,

00:15:29.830 --> 00:15:32.990
fugu poison, strychnine and arsenic.

00:15:33.500 --> 00:15:36.900
The ones on their opposite side do not.

00:15:36.900 --> 00:15:41.870
You'll choose one, 
and I'll take its opposite.

00:15:42.180 --> 00:15:46.900
If I take the poison, I'll tell you 
where Hijikata-san is before I die.

00:15:47.380 --> 00:15:52.680
And if you take the poison, 
I promise to save Hijikata-san's life.

00:15:54.730 --> 00:15:57.470
Where is Hijikata-san?

00:15:57.470 --> 00:16:01.380
Speaking from my experience, there's very
 little air left in the coffin.

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:03.230
He's got 30 minutes left at most.

00:16:05.850 --> 00:16:10.430
I'm interested in the fates of people 
who have some kind of strong will.

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:18.120
Kadokura-san, if you're following the 
right path, fate will side with you, not me.

00:16:18.120 --> 00:16:24.740
You don't care about the tattoos, 
or even the gold, do you?

00:16:24.740 --> 00:16:28.460
You're after us, the people coming after them.

00:16:28.880 --> 00:16:34.610
<i>What motivates Sekiya's actions are these 
tests of luck that he calls "trials."</i>

00:16:35.000 --> 00:16:36.450
<i>I was born under a star</i>

00:16:36.450 --> 00:16:39.600
<i>that guarantees I'll always make the 
wrong choice at times like these.</i>

00:16:40.100 --> 00:16:43.370
<i>Even if only one of the cocoons had poison,</i>

00:16:43.370 --> 00:16:45.850
<i>I'm confident it would be the one I'd pick.</i>

00:16:48.030 --> 00:16:49.180
<i>But...</i>

00:16:49.770 --> 00:16:56.820
<i>Even so... if I can save Hijikata-san's 
life in exchange for my end...</i>

00:17:01.590 --> 00:17:05.980
Will you let me talk about myself 
a little until we know who won?

00:17:07.580 --> 00:17:09.930
It happened one Sunday morning...

00:17:12.490 --> 00:17:15.710
I was returning home with my young daughter.

00:17:16.170 --> 00:17:19.460
She was toddling along right in front of me.

00:17:22.190 --> 00:17:26.850
Something exploded next to us. I passed out.

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:40.410
My daughter lost her legs and part of her head.

00:17:40.410 --> 00:17:44.330
It took a while to figure out 
that we'd been hit by lightning.

00:17:48.300 --> 00:17:50.820
Why was my daughter chosen?

00:17:51.910 --> 00:17:54.450
Why not me?

00:17:55.780 --> 00:17:58.180
Is "luck" the will of God?

00:17:58.600 --> 00:18:04.450
If someone like me survived, 
doesn't that mean that there is no God?

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:08.940
If it started kicking it at ten minutes, 
that means it's the wolfsbane.

00:18:10.870 --> 00:18:12.310
Keep your promise.

00:18:12.620 --> 00:18:16.070
Save Hijikata-san...

00:18:16.670 --> 00:18:18.540
I'll dig him out now.

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:27.020
How long will it take me to die?

00:18:27.580 --> 00:18:29.470
You'll suffer for several hours.

00:18:31.080 --> 00:18:33.460
Well, that sucks...

00:18:48.050 --> 00:18:50.830
<i>Hijikata-san, I'm sorry.</i>

00:18:50.830 --> 00:18:53.640
<i>I can't go with you any farther.</i>

00:18:56.290 --> 00:18:59.010
<i>Hijikata Toshizou is still useful.</i>

00:18:59.380 --> 00:19:02.280
<i>I'll move him while the fugu 
poison is still in his system.</i>

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:07.700
<i>Next I'll set up a trial for the Ainu,
 or perhaps Ushiyama again...</i>

00:19:16.960 --> 00:19:21.980
I guess my time as a medicine-seller 
when I was young paid off.

00:19:22.310 --> 00:19:26.810
Luck alone isn't enough 
to survive in these times.

00:19:26.810 --> 00:19:27.900
Huh?

00:19:30.680 --> 00:19:33.060
I feel better.

00:19:33.560 --> 00:19:38.090
<i>By sheer coincidence, the other two poisons 
that Kadokura took to end his suffering</i>

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:41.030
<i>were both fugu!</i>

00:19:41.270 --> 00:19:49.890
<i>Wolfsbane and fugu tetrodotoxin both have 
the effect of neutralizing one another!</i>

00:19:50.200 --> 00:19:54.520
<i>Kadokura had, with incredible luck, 
taken just the right amount of fugu poison</i>

00:19:54.520 --> 00:19:58.880
<i>to cancel out the wolfsbane, and they 
both disappeared from his system.</i>

00:19:58.880 --> 00:20:03.510
<i>As for Hijikata Toshizou, as the 
fugu poison made him pass out,</i>

00:20:03.510 --> 00:20:10.030
<i>he secretly, and deliberately, took just 
enough wolfsbane to make the dose non-fatal!</i>

00:20:11.700 --> 00:20:15.990
So he knew he took fugu poison and 
immediately took wolfsbane, too?

00:20:16.410 --> 00:20:19.900
He was able to find the wolfsbane 
from among the cocoons?

00:20:20.550 --> 00:20:23.150
There was arsenic and strychnine, too!

00:20:26.310 --> 00:20:32.290
If not taking it meant certain death,
 I had to take my chance.

00:20:32.580 --> 00:20:37.500
Let's say that guts and experience 
brought fate to my side.

00:20:38.040 --> 00:20:39.420
Impossible.

00:20:39.950 --> 00:20:42.340
That's... a miracle!

00:20:42.730 --> 00:20:45.720
Yes... a miracle!

00:20:45.720 --> 00:20:47.950
Which means God is real after all!

00:20:48.550 --> 00:20:51.630
Don't you think so, Hijikata-san?

00:20:53.290 --> 00:20:58.090
God has finally judged me, at least!

00:21:01.960 --> 00:21:03.930
He killed and killed

00:21:03.930 --> 00:21:08.660
to resolve the conflict between his faith 
and his daughter's sudden, unlucky death,

00:21:08.660 --> 00:21:12.000
until he made himself into a monster.

00:21:12.890 --> 00:21:18.250
Because in his mind, his daughter's death 
had to be God's way of punishing him.

00:21:18.250 --> 00:21:20.780
I don't know anything about God.

00:21:20.780 --> 00:21:23.780
I'm only interested in the world of man.

00:21:25.020 --> 00:21:29.280
When you're born into this world, 
how do you spend your life?

00:21:29.280 --> 00:21:31.010
That's all I care about.

00:21:31.010 --> 00:21:36.700
Let's just hope we can put 
his tattoos to good use.

00:21:37.410 --> 00:21:40.300
Is Kadokura okay, I wonder?

00:21:59.060 --> 00:22:01.160
<i>Thank you, Pussy.</i>

00:22:03.210 --> 00:22:04.710
<i>I'll never forget you!</i>

00:23:35.140 --> 00:23:40.250
<b>Next Time
The Smell of Sulfur</b>

00:23:35.580 --> 00:23:38.790
<i>Next time: "The Smell of Sulfur"!</i>
